title: metarecord-list:open-bulk-edit
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Metarecord list: open the bulk edit / delete form (set/add/remove/unset/delete)

Opens, or closes, the form at the bottom of the [[metarecord-list panel]] that sets, adds, removes or unsets a field — or deletes the metarecords — over the checked selection or the query shown ([[Editing metarecords in the GUI]]).
